{"category":"policyArea","conceptIdentityClaimed":false,"definition":"Primary focus of measure is matters affecting foreign aid, human rights, international law and organizations; national governance; passports for U.S. nationals; arms control; diplomacy and foreign officials; alliances and collective security. Measures concerning trade agreements, tariffs, foreign investments, and foreign loans may fall under Foreign Trade and International Finance policy area.","id":"urn:ref:crs-source-record:16d806e4a07df391de776d0bd5fade9d0bce89fe33b564036c94e0749df91326:policyArea:%2Fhelp%2Ffield-values%2Fpolicy-area:21","identifiers":[],"identityStatus":"publisherIdentifierAbsent","labels":[{"language":"en","role":"preferred","value":"International Affairs"}],"localRecordId":"urn:uuid:019fc9f2-c758-72fe-afe2-aa65eb6e4844","publisherReleaseStatus":"namedReleaseAbsent","resourceName":"policyAreas","sourceArtifact":"urn:ref:crs-source-artifact:policyArea:16d806e4a07df391de776d0bd5fade9d0bce89fe33b564036c94e0749df91326","sourceFetchId":"019fb31d-7cd0-71a4-a23c-d3a206d345f7","sourceObservedAt":"2026-07-30T13:01:22Z","sourceOrdinal":21,"sourcePath":"fieldValues/policyArea[21]","sourceUrl":"https://www.congress.gov/help/field-values/policy-area","uses":["navigation","sourceAssignedEvidence"]}
{"category":"policyArea","conceptIdentityClaimed":false,"definition":"Primary focus of measure is matters affecting hiring and composition of the workforce, wages and benefits, labor-management relations; occupational safety, personnel management, unemployment compensation, pensions. Measures concerning public-sector employment may fall under Government Operations and Politics policy area.","id":"urn:ref:crs-source-record:16d806e4a07df391de776d0bd5fade9d0bce89fe33b564036c94e0749df91326:policyArea:%2Fhelp%2Ffield-values%2Fpolicy-area:22","identifiers":[],"identityStatus":"publisherIdentifierAbsent","labels":[{"language":"en","role":"preferred","value":"Labor and Employment"}],"localRecordId":"urn:uuid:019fc9f2-c758-73ed-9c71-0e182f08c846","publisherReleaseStatus":"namedReleaseAbsent","resourceName":"policyAreas","sourceArtifact":"urn:ref:crs-source-artifact:policyArea:16d806e4a07df391de776d0bd5fade9d0bce89fe33b564036c94e0749df91326","sourceFetchId":"019fb31d-7cd0-71a4-a23c-d3a206d345f7","sourceObservedAt":"2026-07-30T13:01:22Z","sourceOrdinal":22,"sourcePath":"fieldValues/policyArea[22]","sourceUrl":"https://www.congress.gov/help/field-values/policy-area","uses":["navigation","sourceAssignedEvidence"]}
{"category":"policyArea","conceptIdentityClaimed":false,"definition":"Primary focus of measure is matters affecting civil actions and administrative remedies, courts and judicial administration, general constitutional issues, dispute resolution, including mediation and arbitration. Measures concerning specific constitutional amendments may fall under the policy area relevant to the subject matter of the amendment (e.g., Education). Measures concerning criminal procedure and law enforcement may fall under Crime and Law Enforcement policy area.","id":"urn:ref:crs-source-record:16d806e4a07df391de776d0bd5fade9d0bce89fe33b564036c94e0749df91326:policyArea:%2Fhelp%2Ffield-values%2Fpolicy-area:23","identifiers":[],"identityStatus":"publisherIdentifierAbsent","labels":[{"language":"en","role":"preferred","value":"Law"}],"localRecordId":"urn:uuid:019fc9f2-c758-7207-8928-11b57baf0261","publisherReleaseStatus":"namedReleaseAbsent","resourceName":"policyAreas","sourceArtifact":"urn:ref:crs-source-artifact:policyArea:16d806e4a07df391de776d0bd5fade9d0bce89fe33b564036c94e0749df91326","sourceFetchId":"019fb31d-7cd0-71a4-a23c-d3a206d345f7","sourceObservedAt":"2026-07-30T13:01:22Z","sourceOrdinal":23,"sourcePath":"fieldValues/policyArea[23]","sourceUrl":"https://www.congress.gov/help/field-values/policy-area","uses":["navigation","sourceAssignedEvidence"]}
